/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:9:The owned output is [v025-stagec-c3-coalition-20260910-BUILD_NOT_CLAIM](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/artifacts/v025-stagec-c3-coalition-20260910-BUILD_NOT_CLAIM). It contains a combined read-only-input projection under `corpus/.staging-separated-v1`: 22 copied C1/C2 view shards and 22 newly generated `mcrl-v025-stagec-c3-coalition-shard-v2` shards, with a valid `.sha256` sidecar beside every JSONL file. The machine-readable result is [BUILD_NOT_CLAIM-coalition-verification.json](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/artifacts/v025-stagec-c3-coalition-20260910-BUILD_NOT_CLAIM/BUILD_NOT_CLAIM-coalition-verification.json).
