/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:39:For each anchor, one fresh nominal `StepEvaluator` with `boundary_indices=(0,)` received the canonical default configuration and every multi-user catalogue configuration in one `evaluate_many` call. No singleton configuration was sent to an evaluator. This matches the stored physics header’s declared current candidate/default path. Forecasts were not regenerated because C3 needs the immediate `Delta F(A)` only; the already-stored C2 forecast quantities were not changed.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:45:### Required C3 schema
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:47:The runner first authenticates and validates canonical exact-source JSONL ([run_stagec_training.py:217](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_stagec_training.py:217)); it inventories only `views` paths ([lines 274–288](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_stagec_training.py:274)); then it dispatches exact C1/C2 and C3 schemas, requires both families, and requires one common physics digest ([lines 291–326](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_stagec_training.py:291)).
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:49:The exact C3 row fields were taken from the `CoalitionRow` declaration at [coalitions.py:290](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/src/mcrl/stagec_v025/coalitions.py:290). Its constructor requires TRAIN rows of size at least two, the complete changed-user inventory, calibrated float-hex prices, authority digests, and both reconstruction identities ([lines 325–383](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/src/mcrl/stagec_v025/coalitions.py:325)). The writer’s canonical JSONL header and sidecar path are at [lines 556–579](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/src/mcrl/stagec_v025/coalitions.py:556), and the reader checks header equality, canonical bytes, exact row fields, row digests, and context digests at [lines 709–774](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/src/mcrl/stagec_v025/coalitions.py:709).
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:51:All emitted C3 rows carry physics digest `38e1998aa8c1f4a751bca5456ec7e900feed16c52d38504bb76d28b556130b55`, exactly the digest carried by the copied C1/C2 views.
