/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:56:- Decomposition: maximum exact residual for both `C1 + Psi - Delta F` and the physical-without-`Phi` identity was `0/1` during row construction.
