/home/sat/mcrl-v025-coalgen-ws/C3-COALITION-BUILD-2026-09-10.md:71:The support is strongly pairwise-dominated: only 316/4,552 rows (6.942004%) have size greater than two. This is consistent with the prior `C3REACH` observation that `contexts.get(...) is None` on 79.164% of legal catalogue rows; it bounds what a future C3 fit could learn but is not a fit or performance result.
