| 2 | `nominal_required_power_over_cap` | Per-option **configuration** result | No. It is the profile-wide maximum required power divided by the cap, not the focal link's gain ([`run_v025_pilot_c3.py:652`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py:652), [`batch.py:351`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/src/mcrl/physics_v025/batch.py:351)). |
| 3 | `nominal_mode_spectral_efficiency` | Per-option **configuration** result | No. It is the profile mean ACM SE, aggregated across active users ([`run_v025_pilot_c3.py:657`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py:657), [`batch.py:362`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/src/mcrl/physics_v025/batch.py:362)). |
| 4 | `background_occupancy_excluding_focal` | Per-option beam | No; occupancy is not wanted-link gain ([`run_v025_pilot_c3.py:647`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py:647)). |
| 5 | `satellite_active_before_focal` | Per-option satellite indicator | No ([`run_v025_pilot_c3.py:658`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py:658)). |
