| 10 | `refresh_phase` | Anchor/user value repeated across options | No; not an option ranker. |
| 11 | `previous_served_association_for_action` | Per-option incumbency indicator | No. |
| 12 | `previous_served_load_for_action` | Per-option previous beam load | No. |
| 13 | `previous_satellite_active_for_action` | Per-option previous satellite indicator | No. |
