Fields 8–15 are defined in order at [`q1_schema_v2.py:84`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-design-ws/q1_schema_v2.py:84), and their exact-path values are assembled at [`run_v025_pilot_c3.py:662`](/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/scripts/run_v025_pilot_c3.py:662).

